      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOLLIPOP VALLEY (8) flew the lids with a fast early split last time, hitting the frame with a 3 length second (20.31) over 350m at this track and making it two placings on end. Top prospect. OUR MIRACLES (1) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 5.5 lengths third (20.57) over 350m at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Bold showing expected. SPITFIRE REIGN (7) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (20.44) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. WAGYU BOY (2) is not to be discarded.",
